notes.content:
Back by popular demand! 

The free demo for The Last Alchemist is back and ready to welcome you into a wondrous world of science and discovery. It's here for one week only, so play while you still can!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42847124/9d4932b49b34ac2260433a2ed1763408fc1391c9.png[/img]

We know you had a lot of feedback after playing the Summer Game Fest demo, so we've listened and made some changes for this latest iteration. Among other items the following have been updated: 
[list]
[*] The camera and movement have been improved - please also have a look in the options for the sliders that will help you create your perfect experience;
[*] A quick sell feature is available - you can use E to sell items from inventory, in addition to the drag and drop option; 
[*] An autofill feature is available - you can use E to fill slots automatically, in addition to the drag and drop option; 
[*] Some of the objectives have been re-worked so they are easier to follow;  
[*] An introduction was added and the tutorial has been re-worked; 
[*] Additional visual cues have been added to help with the display of the time system and your energy; 
[*] The time and length of monologues displayed has been optimized; 
[*] Steam Cloud saves have been added; 
[*] And a few other UI/UX changes, lighting, animation and VFXs have been added or updated as well as bug fixes, performance optimisation updates and improvements have been made! 
[/list] 
Please note that save data from the previous demo will not be compatible with this version. 

We'd love to hear what you think about this version of the The Last Alchemist demo, so please leave your thoughts in the forums or our [url=https://discord.com/invite/M8AyV5USEr]Discord[/url] and our team is guaranteed to read them. 

Thank you, and enjoy your time as an Alchemist!
